# Swift Conventions

- Feature folders under `Features/`; reusable views under `Components/`
- Models in `Models/`, enums in `Enums/`, constants in `Constants/`
- Network access only via `Services/`
- Match design tokens (navy, green CTA, large corner radius, soft shadows)
- Status colors: green GOOD, orange SO_SO, red BAD